---
title: "Sequence: running a job, from its start to ingestion"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box Service account
    participant S as EventBridge Scheduler
    participant A as Framework API
    participant W as Job workflow
    participant B as AWS Batch job
    participant Q as Ingestion queue
  end
  box Tenant account
    participant R as Source-access role
    participant K as Destination bucket
    participant KB as Bedrock knowledge base
  end
  participant G as Source
  S->>A: Start the job on its schedule
  Note over A: A tenant can call StartCustomConnectorJob instead
  A->>W: Record the job STARTED, start its execution
  W->>B: Mark the job RUNNING, submit it, and wait
  B->>R: Assume the role with the external ID
  B->>G: Read the source
  B->>K: Write new and changed files
  B->>A: Record the documents, save checkpoints
  B-->>W: Exit 0, or 70 when the implementation raised
  Note over W: Record SUCCEEDED or FAILED, release the custom connector
  opt A successful job on a BEDROCK destination
    W->>Q: Queue one ingestion request
    Q->>KB: Start ingestion through the destination role
  end
